flowchart TB
    accTitle: Peer discovery and runtime paths
    accDescr: Candidates pass admission; active data connections and membership control are separate paths. Gossip and repair do not require membership Alive.
    Candidates["Endpoint candidates<br/>Discovery or manual registration"]
    Admission["Handshake and identity policy<br/>Version, TLS, allowlist and capacity"]
    Data["Active data connection<br/>Admitted transport generation"]
    Control["Membership control<br/>Independent one-shot RPCs"]
    Gossip["Gossip and anti-entropy<br/>Send operations and repair gaps"]
    Membership["Member view and probes<br/>Alive, Suspect, Dead or Left"]
    Observe["Independent observation views<br/>Connection or Alive does not prove recovery"]
    Candidates --> Admission
    Admission -->|"Data admission"| Data
    Admission -->|"Control admission"| Control
    Data --> Gossip
    Control --> Membership
    Gossip --> Observe
    Membership --> Observe
